---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro'; import LineChart from '../components/LineChart.astro'; import growth from '../data/growth.json'; const pct=Math.round(growth.study.total/growth.study.goal*100);
---
<Base title="成长仪表盘 · 刘映杰"><section class="page-intro"><p class="eyebrow">GROWTH DASHBOARD</p><h1>行动留下数据，<br>数据解释成长。</h1><p>{growth.label} · Last updated {growth.updated}</p></section><section class="section"><div class="metrics large"><article><span>今日学习</span><strong>{growth.study.today}<small> 小时</small></strong></article><article><span>本周学习</span><strong>{growth.study.week}<small> 小时</small></strong></article><article><span>累计学习</span><strong>{growth.study.total}<small> 小时</small></strong></article><article><span>连续行动</span><strong>{growth.study.streak}<small> 天</small></strong></article></div></section><section class="section split"><div><p class="eyebrow">STUDY</p><h2>考研学习进度</h2><p class="big-number">{pct}%</p><progress value={growth.study.total} max={growth.study.goal}>{pct}%</progress><p>{growth.study.total} / {growth.study.goal} 小时 · 示例目标</p></div><LineChart values={growth.study.weekly} label="每周学习时长" unit="小时 · 示例数据" /></section><section class="section split"><LineChart values={growth.fitness.weight} label="体重趋势" unit="kg · 示例数据" color="#188038"/><div><p class="eyebrow">BODY & SPORT</p><h2>训练不是爱好标签，<br>是长期身体管理。</h2><ul class="plain-list"><li>健身训练 <b>{growth.fitness.workouts} 次</b></li><li>篮球训练 <b>{growth.basketball.sessions} 次</b></li><li>篮球时长 <b>{growth.basketball.hours} 小时</b></li></ul></div></section></Base>
